## 🚫 Icon Usage Anti-Patterns

### ❌ Don't Use Invalid Icon Names

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG: These icons don't exist
<i className="modus-icons">invalid-icon</i>
<i className="modus-icons">non_existent_icon</i>
<i className="modus-icons">custom-icon</i>
```

### ❌ Don't Use Non-Modus Icon Libraries

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG: Don't mix icon libraries
<i className="fa fa-star"></i>  {/* Font Awesome */}
<i className="material-icons">star</i>  {/* Material Icons */}
```

### ❌ Don't Hardcode Colors

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG: Hardcoded colors
<i className="modus-icons" style={{ color: "#ff0000" }}>star</i>
<i className="modus-icons" style={{ color: "blue" }}>star</i>

// ✅ CORRECT: Use Modus color variables
<i className="modus-icons" style={{ color: "var(--modus-wc-color-error)" }}>star</i>
<i className="modus-icons text-destructive">star</i>
```

### ❌ Don't Forget Accessibility

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG: Missing aria-label for functional icon
<ModusWcButton shape="circle">
  <i className="modus-icons">delete</i>
</ModusWcButton>

// ✅ CORRECT: Include aria-label
<ModusWcButton shape="circle" aria-label="Delete item">
  <i className="modus-icons">delete</i>
</ModusWcButton>

// ✅ CORRECT: Using ModusButton with proper accessibility
<ModusButton
  icon="delete"
  iconPosition="only"
  aria-label="Delete item"
  color="danger"
/>
```

